    16	
    17	- The BC run's PPO config `configs/kaggriculture_1gpu_eager.yaml`, `configs/kaggriculture_2rank.yaml`, `configs/kaggriculture_4rank.yaml` and the integration branch's `configs/kaggriculture_8rank.yaml` have equal `model`, `obs_spec` and `action_spec` sections. The 8-rank file was checked at `kg/isaiah-gap-closure` `faed717` and `5b43062`. `force_flash_attn` has to be false for a CPU forward. It selects a kernel and changes no parameter.
    18	- The real checkpoint (SHA-256 checked against the pod and its record) loads through `PPOTrainer.load_model_weights`, the call `run_ppo` makes on a fresh launch. The eager, 2-rank and 8-rank models then give equal values, winner probabilities and log-probs on rows of a real validation shard. The outputs are finite, and the policy-seat turn NLL on those rows is 0.419.
