One P3 documentation correction is needed: 97.2% means **700 of 720 seat-value predictions**, not 97.2% of turn rows. The gradient probe uses each model’s opposite prediction as its target, and the evidence does not establish that the critic learned team identity. These limits do not invalidate the fresh-head choice.
